    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βού-θῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				sacrifices</i>, esp. <i>of oxen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					706
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					664
				</span></i>
			; <i>accompanied by sacrifices</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					3.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>on which oxen are offered, sacrificial</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑστία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1495
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1232
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦμαρ, ἁμέρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				261
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1474
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
